@psl_courting
title: PiS calls the PSL offices
new-page: true

= The agrarian hinge

PiS has **[+ pis_seats +] seats**. Even every one of PSL's **[+ psl_seats +]
deputies** would only produce **[+ coalition_pis_psl_seats +]** before any
other defection. That does not make the offer meaningless: ministries,
agricultural agencies and a conservative social truce could split Third Way,
then invite individual deputies from elsewhere.

PSL itself is not one vote. Its **[+ psl_core_seats +]-seat core**, **[+
psl_regional_seats +] regional brokers** and **[+ psl_conservative_seats +]
especially conservative deputies** hear different promises. The threat to
leave a coalition is also how the party increases its value inside one.

- @psl_public_lock
- @psl_rural_counteroffer
- @psl_free_hand

@psl_public_lock
title: Bind PSL to a named democratic protocol
subtitle: Cost: 1 party resource. Public rural guarantees in exchange for zero PiS votes.
choose-if: resources >= 1
unavailable-subtitle: A common negotiating and communications team costs one resource.
on-arrival: resources -= 1; first_psl_yes = 0; first_psl_abstain = 0; psl_relation += 5; third_way_cohesion += 6; formation_discipline += 1; news_headline = "PSL signs its name under the democratic transfer"
go-to: left_courting

@psl_rural_counteroffer
title: Beat PiS to the rural and local-government guarantees
subtitle: Cost: 2 party resources. Expensive solidarity, but it closes the agency auction.
choose-if: resources >= 2
unavailable-subtitle: A costed rural package and local negotiations require two resources.
on-arrival: resources -= 2; first_psl_yes = 0; first_psl_abstain = 0; psl_relation += 9; labor_credibility += 3; rural_support += 4; annual_rural_guarantee = 1; news_headline = "A democratic rural protocol deprives PiS of its easiest offer"
go-to: left_courting

@psl_free_hand
title: Do not police PSL's talks
subtitle: The dangerous bargain: PSL's caucuses decide from their own relations, wings and Third Way cohesion.
on-arrival: {!
const pslSeats = Math.max(0, Number(Q.psl_seats) || 0);
const pslConservatives = Math.max(
    0,
    Number(Q.psl_conservative_seats) || 0
);
const pslRegional = Math.max(0, Number(Q.psl_regional_seats) || 0);
const offerStrength =
    (Number(Q.pis_accept_social) || 0) * 0.35 +
    (Number(Q.pis_accept_order) || 0) * 0.25 +
    (Number(Q.rival_relation_pis_psl) || 0) * 0.25;
const allianceShield =
    (Number(Q.psl_relation) || 0) * 0.30 +
    (Number(Q.third_way_cohesion) || 0) * 0.35;
const brokerPool = Math.min(
    pslSeats,
    pslConservatives + Math.round(pslRegional * 0.75)
);
const pslTemptation = Math.max(
    0,
    Math.min(
        1,
        0.22 + (offerStrength - allianceShield) / 100 +
        (this.random.uint32() / 4294967296 - 0.5) * 0.18
    )
);
Q.first_psl_yes = Math.min(
    pslSeats,
    Math.round(brokerPool * pslTemptation)
);
Q.first_psl_abstain = Math.min(
    Math.max(0, pslSeats - Q.first_psl_yes),
    Math.round(
        Math.max(0, brokerPool - Q.first_psl_yes) * 0.45
    ),
    Math.max(0, Q.psl_seats - Q.first_psl_yes)
);
Q.psl_relation -= 10;
Q.p2050_relation -= 8;
Q.third_way_cohesion -= 18;
Q.party_unity -= 2;
Q.public_trust -= 3;
Q.news_headline =
    Q.first_psl_yes + " PSL deputies accept the PiS offer and " +
    Q.first_psl_abstain + " abstain";
!}
go-to: left_courting

@left_courting
title: Morawiecki offers the Left a social ledger
new-page: true

= A programme without trust

The designated candidate talks about pharmacies, Sunday trading, public-sector
pay and housing. The offer is designed for television and for the Left's
internal fault line: **[+ left_barons_seats +] old SLD barons** value access
and social conservatism; **[+ left_new_generation_seats +] younger,
women-led deputies** demand rights; Wiosna wants equality; Razem wants
enforceable labour and housing policy.

PiS does not need all **[+ left_seats +]**. It needs photographs, abstentions
and the argument that the democratic coalition has no monopoly on social
policy.

- @left_united_rejection
- @left_extract_and_expose
- @left_issue_pact

