@right_auction
title: Konfederacja names its price
new-page: true

= The last pool of votes

Konfederacja's 18 deputies are a federation, not a disciplined successor to a
Weimar mass movement. Nationalists want a harder border and culture war;
libertarians want tax concessions; Grzegorz Braun's two closest deputies want
spectacle and impunity. PiS can buy parts of that menu but not assume the whole
club.

The Left's choice is whether to make the auction politically toxic or let the
right negotiate in the hope that its contradictions defeat it.

- @konf_isolate
- @konf_counterprogram
- @konf_let_bid

@konf_isolate
title: Build a common constitutional cordon
subtitle: Cost: 1 party resource. Make every confidence vote a recorded choice.
choose-if: resources >= 1
unavailable-subtitle: A cross-party whip and public record require one resource.
on-arrival: resources -= 1; first_konf_yes = 0; first_konf_abstain = 0; formation_discipline += 1; constitutional_restraint += 4; far_right_agenda -= 2; news_headline = "The democratic clubs deny Konfederacja a hidden auction"
go-to: first_confidence_roll

@konf_counterprogram
title: Separate material grievances from the far-right package
subtitle: A visible workers-and-small-business answer; two Konfederacja deputies abstain.
on-arrival: first_konf_yes = 0; first_konf_abstain = 2; labor_credibility += 3; rural_support += 2; far_right_agenda -= 1; news_headline = "Lewica contests the grievance vote without laundering the far right"
go-to: first_confidence_roll

@konf_let_bid
title: Let PiS and Konfederacja bid against each other
subtitle: Konfederacja's autonomous wings decide how many votes, if any, PiS can buy.
on-arrival: {!
const konfSeats = Math.max(0, Number(Q.konf_seats) || 0);
const pisKonfRelation = Number(Q.rival_relation_pis_konf) || 0;
const konfDealSpace =
    pisKonfRelation * 0.40 +
    (Number(Q.konf_mentzenite_share) || 0) * 0.18 +
    (Number(Q.konf_nationalist_share) || 0) * 0.12 -
    (Number(Q.konf_braunist_share) || 0) * 0.20 +
    (Number(Q.pis_coalition_openness) || 0) * 0.08;
const konfTransferShare = Math.max(
    0,
    Math.min(
        0.65,
        0.08 + konfDealSpace / 150 +
        (this.random.uint32() / 4294967296 - 0.5) * 0.16
    )
);
Q.first_konf_yes = Math.min(
    konfSeats,
    Math.round(konfSeats * konfTransferShare)
);
Q.first_konf_abstain = Math.min(
    Math.round(
        Math.max(0, konfSeats - Q.first_konf_yes) * 0.22
    ),
    Math.max(0, Q.konf_seats - Q.first_konf_yes)
);
Q.far_right_agenda += 8;
Q.minority_safety -= 5;
Q.public_trust -= 2;
Q.news_headline =
    Q.first_konf_yes + " Konfederacja deputies back the PiS bargain";
!}
go-to: first_confidence_roll

@first_confidence_roll
title: Morawiecki asks for confidence
new-page: true
on-arrival: {!
const boundedFirst = function(value, low, high) {
    const numeric = Number.isFinite(Number(value)) ? Number(value) : low;
    return Math.max(low, Math.min(high, Math.round(numeric)));
};
const pslYes = boundedFirst(Q.first_psl_yes, 0, Q.psl_seats);
const pslAbstain = boundedFirst(
    Q.first_psl_abstain,
    0,
    Math.max(0, Q.psl_seats - pslYes)
);
const leftYes = boundedFirst(Q.first_left_yes, 0, Q.left_seats);
const leftAbstain = boundedFirst(
    Q.first_left_abstain,
    0,
    Math.max(0, Q.left_seats - leftYes)
);
const konfYes = boundedFirst(Q.first_konf_yes, 0, Q.konf_seats);
const konfAbstain = boundedFirst(
    Q.first_konf_abstain,
    0,
    Math.max(0, Q.konf_seats - konfYes)
);
const firstYesTransfers = pslYes + leftYes + konfYes;
const firstAbstainTransfers = pslAbstain + leftAbstain + konfAbstain;
const pisAbsent = boundedFirst(Q.first_pis_absent, 0, Q.pis_seats);
const pisYes = Math.max(0, Q.pis_seats - pisAbsent);
Q.confidence_stage = 1;
Q.confidence_mode =
    "Article 154 first attempt — absolute majority of deputies present";
Q.confidence_candidate = "Mateusz Morawiecki";
Q.confidence_yes = pisYes + firstYesTransfers;
Q.confidence_abstain = firstAbstainTransfers;
Q.confidence_no = Math.max(0,
    Q.sejm_total - pisAbsent - Q.confidence_yes - Q.confidence_abstain
);
Q.confidence_present =
    Q.confidence_yes + Q.confidence_no + Q.confidence_abstain;
Q.confidence_threshold = Math.floor(Q.confidence_present / 2) + 1;
Q.morawiecki_votes = Q.confidence_yes;
Q.first_confidence_passed =
    Q.confidence_present >= Q.sejm_quorum_floor &&
    Q.confidence_yes > Q.confidence_no + Q.confidence_abstain ? 1 : 0;
if (Q.first_confidence_passed) {
    Q.news_headline = "Morawiecki finds an alternative majority";
} else {
    Q.news_headline = "The presidential first attempt fails";
}
!}

= First attempt — the Palace's candidate

Article 154 requires an **absolute majority among deputies present**, with at
least half the statutory Sejm present. Abstentions therefore raise the hurdle
just like votes against.

<div class="ledger-section ledger-section-first"><div class="ledger-title">Roll
call</div>
<div class="ledger-row"><span>Candidate</span><b>Mateusz Morawiecki</b></div>
<div class="ledger-row"><span>Yes</span><b>[+ confidence_yes +]</b></div>
<div class="ledger-row"><span>No</span><b>[+ confidence_no +]</b></div>
<div class="ledger-row"><span>Abstain</span><b>[+ confidence_abstain +]</b></div>
<div class="ledger-row"><span>Present</span><b>[+ confidence_present +]</b></div>
<div class="ledger-row"><span>Required</span><b>[+ confidence_threshold +]</b></div></div>

[? if not first_confidence_passed: The cabinet fails. In the historical
configuration the board reads **190–266**, and the initiative passes to the
Sejm. ?]

[? if first_confidence_passed: The cabinet survives because separate PSL, Left
and Konfederacja bargains became one numerical majority. Nobody can now claim
that those agreements were merely exploratory. ?]

- @first_confidence_continue: Continue from the roll call

@first_confidence_continue
go-to: morawiecki_cabinet if first_confidence_passed = 1; sejm_candidate if first_confidence_passed = 0

@morawiecki_cabinet
title: An alternative majority takes office
new-page: true
on-arrival: {!
Q.left_in_government = 0;
Q.formation_complete = 1;
Q.caretaker_government = 0;
Q.government_has_confidence = 1;
Q.prime_minister = "Mateusz Morawiecki";
Q.government_name = "PiS-led bargain cabinet";
Q.government_party = "pis";
Q.government_owner = "PiS and its governing partners";
Q.position = "Parliamentary opposition";
Q.coalition_status = "PiS-led confidence pact";
Q.coalition_seats = Math.max(0, Number(Q.pis_seats) || 0);
Q.left_cabinet_committed = 0;
Q.left_cabinet_model = "Opposition";
Q.ministries_finalized = 1;
Q.ministry_allocation_mode = "settled";
Q.budget = 0;
Q.budget_authority = "Opposition — no state spending authority";
Q.ending_name = "The democratic transfer dissolved before taking office";
if (Q.formation_continuous) {
    Q.formation_outcome_score = 12;
    Q.ending_score =
        (Number.isFinite(Number(Q.ending_score)) ? Number(Q.ending_score) : 0) -
        8;
} else {
    Q.ending_score = 12;
}
Q.party_unity -= 8;
!}

= The majority that was supposed not to exist

Morawiecki has confidence. A confidence vote is not automatically a coalition
agreement: some PSL and Left deputies may have bought issues without taking
ministries, while Konfederacja reserves the right to deny responsibility. The
result is still a government, and the Left is still outside it.

There is no government budget interface here. Opposition can propose,
condition or reject spending, but it cannot spend the cabinet's fiscal
capacity.

- @formation_exit: Record the new opposition

