@democratic_left_mandate
title: One club is not one instruction
new-page: true

= The Left decides what “joining” means

The main list holds **[+ left_seats +] seats** across the active caucuses.
Separate Left parties hold **[+ left_splinter_seats +]** more; only **[+
left_splinter_support_votes +]** of those begin committed to a common
candidate. Razem's **[+ razem_seats +] internal-list deputies** still answer
to their own executive.

Only a cabinet that actually contains Lewica will grant the player government
authority. Voting confidence from outside does not.

