@democratic_psl_mandate
title: Third Way writes its escape clauses
new-page: true

= The partner that keeps a hand on the door

Poland 2050 and PSL ran on one list, not as one party. Hołownia wants the
marshalship, institutional repair and proof that a new centre exists. PSL
wants agriculture, local government, defence credibility and freedom from
being made the decisive vote on every cultural question.

How much autonomy does the Left concede before the first roll call?

- @psl_full_protocol
- @psl_conscience_clause
- @psl_free_vote
- @psl_exclusion_threat

