title: One exposé, four coalition readings
new-page: true

= From a candidate to a cabinet

The prime-minister-elect must present ministers and a programme. The same **[+
coalition_democratic_seats +] deputies** now read the coalition agreement
through different caucus mandates. A sentence on abortion can be a promise to
New Left, a red line to PSL, an insufficient timetable to Razem and an
invitation to discipline for KO.

