@third_attempt
title: The President's last attempt
new-page: true

= Article 155 — simple majority, final chance

If the Sejm-led attempt fails, the President appoints another prime minister
and cabinet. The chamber then votes by **more yes than no**, with quorum.
Abstentions no longer raise the majority threshold. If this cabinet also
fails, the President must shorten the Sejm's term.

The Palace, PSL and the exhausted democratic clubs each offer a way to use that
different arithmetic.

- @third_reassemble
- @third_presidential_compromise
- @third_morawiecki_toleration
- @third_szydlo_toleration
- @third_sasin_toleration
- @third_kowalczyk_toleration
- @third_refuse_rescue

@third_reassemble
title: Reassemble the democratic bloc around Tusk and a smaller programme
subtitle: Lewica enters the cabinet; up to seven nervous deputies abstain.
on-arrival: {!
const democraticSeats =
    Q.ko_seats + Q.p2050_seats + Q.centrum_seats +
    Q.psl_seats + Q.left_committed_seats;
const rightSeats =
    Q.pis_seats + Q.konf_seats + Q.rozwoj_seats + Q.korona_seats;
const democraticAbstentions = Math.min(7, democraticSeats);
const rightAbsences = Math.min(
    Math.max(0, Math.round(Number(Q.candidate_right_absent) || 0)),
    rightSeats
);
Q.third_candidate = "Donald Tusk";
Q.third_yes = democraticSeats - democraticAbstentions;
Q.third_no = rightSeats - rightAbsences;
Q.third_abstain = Math.max(
    0,
    Q.sejm_total - rightAbsences -
        Q.third_yes - Q.third_no
);
Q.third_left_cabinet = 1;
Q.left_cabinet_committed = 1;
Q.left_cabinet_model = "Whole Left coalition delegation";
Q.ministries_finalized = 0;
Q.ministry_return_mode = "governing_agreement";
Q.news_headline =
    "The democratic parties try once more under simple-majority rules";
!}
go-to: third_confidence_roll

@third_presidential_compromise
title: Court the Palace for a Kosiniak-Kamysz compromise
subtitle: A broad cabinet containing Lewica, with up to twelve abstentions.
view-if: president_name != "Władysław Kosiniak-Kamysz"
choose-if: presidential_channel_open = 1 or president_relation >= 28
unavailable-subtitle: The Palace will not broker this without an established constitutional channel.
on-arrival: {!
const democraticSeats =
    Q.ko_seats + Q.p2050_seats + Q.centrum_seats +
    Q.psl_seats + Q.left_committed_seats;
const democraticAbstentions = Math.min(12, democraticSeats);
Q.third_candidate = "Władysław Kosiniak-Kamysz";
Q.third_yes = democraticSeats - democraticAbstentions;
Q.third_no =
    Q.pis_seats + Q.konf_seats + Q.rozwoj_seats + Q.korona_seats;
Q.third_abstain = Math.max(
    0,
    Q.sejm_total - Q.third_yes - Q.third_no
);
Q.third_left_cabinet = 1;
Q.left_cabinet_committed = 1;
Q.left_cabinet_model = "New Left ministers · Razem external support";
Q.ministries_finalized = 0;
Q.ministry_return_mode = "governing_agreement";
Q.president_relation += 10;
Q.psl_relation += 8;
Q.ko_relation -= 5;
Q.news_headline = "The Palace accepts a broad Kosiniak-Kamysz cabinet";
!}
go-to: third_confidence_roll

