@third_success
title: A cabinet at the edge of the constitution
new-page: true
on-arrival: {!
Q.formation_complete = 1;
Q.caretaker_government = 0;
Q.government_has_confidence = 1;
Q.prime_minister = Q.third_candidate;
Q.government_name = Q.third_candidate + " third-attempt cabinet";
const thirdCandidateKey =
    String(Q.third_candidate || "").toLowerCase();
if (
    thirdCandidateKey.includes("morawiecki") ||
    thirdCandidateKey.includes("szydło") ||
    thirdCandidateKey.includes("szydlo") ||
    thirdCandidateKey.includes("sasin") ||
    thirdCandidateKey.includes("kowalczyk") ||
    thirdCandidateKey.includes("czarnek")
) {
    Q.government_party = "pis";
    Q.government_owner = "PiS and its governing partners";
} else if (thirdCandidateKey.includes("kosiniak")) {
    Q.government_party = "psl";
    Q.government_owner = "PSL-led coalition";
} else {
    Q.government_party = "ko";
    Q.government_owner = "KO-led democratic coalition";
}
Q.left_in_government = Q.third_left_cabinet ? 1 : 0;
Q.coalition_seats = Q.government_party == "pis"
    ? Math.max(0, Number(Q.pis_seats) || 0)
    : Math.min(
        Number(Q.sejm_total) || 460,
        Math.max(0, Number(Q.ko_seats) || 0) +
        Math.max(0, Number(Q.p2050_seats) || 0) +
        Math.max(0, Number(Q.psl_seats) || 0) +
        (Q.left_in_government
            ? Math.max(0, Number(Q.left_seats) || 0)
            : 0)
    );
if (Q.left_in_government) {
    Q.left_cabinet_committed = 1;
    Q.ministries_finalized = 0;
    Q.ministry_allocation_mode = "formation";
    Q.position = "Coalition government";
    Q.coalition_status = "Third-attempt democratic coalition";
    Q.budget = 5;
    Q.budget_authority = "Governing coalition — negotiated fiscal capacity";
    Q.ending_name = "A government on the third attempt";
    if (Q.formation_continuous) {
        Q.formation_outcome_score = 38;
        Q.ending_score =
            (Number.isFinite(Number(Q.ending_score))
                ? Number(Q.ending_score)
                : 0) + 5;
    } else {
        Q.ending_score = 38;
    }
} else {
    Q.left_cabinet_committed = 0;
    Q.left_cabinet_model = "Opposition";
    Q.ministries_finalized = 1;
    Q.ministry_allocation_mode = "settled";
    Q.position = "Parliamentary opposition";
    Q.coalition_status = "PiS minority tolerated by PSL";
    Q.budget = 0;
    Q.budget_authority = "Opposition — no state spending authority";
    Q.ending_name = "Morawiecki survives by abstention";
    if (Q.formation_continuous) {
        Q.formation_outcome_score = 18;
        Q.ending_score =
            (Number.isFinite(Number(Q.ending_score))
                ? Number(Q.ending_score)
                : 0) - 5;
    } else {
        Q.ending_score = 18;
    }
}
!}

The simple-majority rule has done what the absolute-majority stage could not.
[+ prime_minister +] has a cabinet, but its authority is exactly as broad as
the agreement behind those votes.

- @government_entry_gate: Continue from the formation vote

@early_election
title: The Sejm is shortened
new-page: true
on-arrival: {!
Q.left_in_government = 0;
Q.formation_complete = 1;
Q.government_has_confidence = 0;
Q.caretaker_government = 1;
Q.coalition_status = "No cabinet won confidence";
Q.position = "Election campaign";
Q.budget = 0;
Q.budget_authority = "Opposition — no state spending authority";
Q.ending_name = "A second election";
if (Q.formation_continuous) {
    Q.formation_outcome_score = 10;
    Q.ending_score =
        (Number.isFinite(Number(Q.ending_score)) ? Number(Q.ending_score) : 0) -
        10;
} else {
    Q.ending_score = 10;
}
Q.public_trust -= 6;
Q.early_election_risk = 100;
Q.snap_election_trigger =
    "Mandatory dissolution after failed Article 155 third attempt";
if (Q.formation_continuous) {
    const electionReturnYear = 2023;
    const electionReturnMonth = 12;
    const electionSkippedMonths = Math.max(
        0,
        (electionReturnYear - (Number(Q.year) || electionReturnYear)) * 12 +
            electionReturnMonth -
            (Number(Q.month) || electionReturnMonth)
    );
    Q.time = Math.max(0, Number(Q.time) || 0) + electionSkippedMonths;
    Q.year = electionReturnYear;
    Q.month = electionReturnMonth;
    Q.month_name = "December";
    Q.date_label = "December 2023";
}
!}

= No fourth attempt

The constitutional sequence is exhausted. The President must shorten the term
of the Sejm and order an election. This is not a discretionary threat and not a
presidential cabinet system: there is simply no government with parliamentary
confidence.

- @early_election_campaign: Enter the mandatory election campaign

@early_election_campaign
go-to: poland_events_2026.snap_campaign_launch if formation_continuous = 1; formation_exit if formation_continuous = 0

@governing_agreement
# prose-audit: Grade A — Named party currents and PSL's annual leverage carry the coalition problem without reducing it to a seat formula.
title: Write rules for an impossible coalition
new-page: true
view-if: left_in_government = 1

= January 2024 — four parties, more than four parties

The cabinet contains KO's liberal core and local-government wing, Hołownia's
movement, PSL's agrarian machine, New Left's barons and younger progressive
women—and perhaps Razem ministers. A coalition document between party logos is
not enough. Each mini-party needs a way to lose a dispute without treating it
as grounds to leave.

PSL insists that every annual budget is a new confidence test. The Left knows
that accepting this principle gives the agrarian partner permanent leverage.
It also knows that KO, Poland 2050 and Lewica cannot command 231 votes after a
PSL walkout.

- @agreement_dispute_protocol
- @agreement_bilateral
- @agreement_majority_claim

