@annual_budget
# prose-audit: Grade A — Ministers, Left caucuses and coalition partners negotiate the package; internal support is delivered as a political verdict before the public roll call.
title: The 2025 state budget
new-page: true
view-if: left_in_government = 1

= December 2024 — every promise gets a number

This is the coalition's annual survival test. Our ministers have **[+ budget +]
shares of cabinet bargaining room** left: influence that exists only because
we accepted responsibility for the government, not ordinary party money.

The package must first survive four Left caucuses, then KO, Poland 2050 and
PSL, then an ordinary Sejm vote. For final passage, abstentions do not count
against the bill; the budget needs more yes than no with quorum. Defeat is a
political crisis, not an automatic no-confidence vote.

- @budget_social_investment
- @budget_rural_care
- @budget_fiscal_brake
- @budget_fragmented

