@article160_open
title: The prime minister asks for confidence
new-page: true
view-if: left_in_government = 1

= Article 160 — confidence by simple majority

The prime minister can request a confidence vote. More yes than no is enough
with quorum, so a 216-seat cabinet can survive if PSL abstains while PiS and
Konfederacja cast 212 votes against. If PSL joins the no lobby, arithmetic
reverses.

- @confidence_rural_deal
- @confidence_minority_discipline
- @confidence_left_redline

@confidence_rural_deal
title: Restore PSL with one last rural guarantee
subtitle: Spend 1 governing capacity. Restore every currently committed coalition club.
